  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 607.02 General Education Content Requirements.\n\n(a) Each institution that provides a PEPP shall ensure that each candidate has completed a program of general studies as part of a bachelor’s degree.\n\n(b) The general education program shall include the core competencies outlined in Ed 505.02.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84, EXPIRED 5-16-90\n\nNew. #4851, eff 6-25-90; ss by #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss by #7923, eff 7-24-03, EXPIRED: 7-24-11\n\nNew. #10046, eff 12-17-11; amd by #10295, eff 3-22-13, EXPIRED 12-17-19 in paras (a) and (b)(2)-(4); ss by #13746, eff 9-16-23 (formerly Ed 609.01) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Ed 600)",
